"The following cell uses the estimated [standard "
"error](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Standard_error) of each result and adds"
" them as error bars. See the [`bar` plot "
"documentation](https://matplotlib.org/stable/api/_as_gen/matplotlib.pyplot.bar.html)"
" for a full description of the plot.\n"
msgstr ""
"다음 셀은 각 결과의 추정된 [표준 오차](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Standard_error)를 사용하여 "
"오차 막대로 추가합니다. 플롯에 대한 전체 설명은 [`bar` 플롯 "
"문서](https://matplotlib.org/stable/api/_as_gen/matplotlib.pyplot.bar.html)를 "
"참조하세요.\n"

